    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Apply the same landmark-based geometric morphometrics to raw stage-45 images from control, nicotine, and nicotine-plus-HCN2 tadpoles, then test treatment separation and equivalence of rescued animals to controls.";
